:: 2nd town entarance [Town] {"position":"1975,2400","size":"100,100"}
You enter Oakheart to see a not so great looking place. It seems to have a inn, a shop and a weaponsmith in this part of the town though 

The buildings are made out of wood just like the wall. There is barely any stone used actually... 

